{
  "name": "Living Fire",
  "description": "The culture will not take. It needs heat that does not die. Okafor says the word 'Nether' like it is a diagnosis.",
  "chapter": "zarp:below",
  "order": 1,
  "requires": [
    "zarp:house_calls"
  ],
  "giver": {
    "type": "npc",
    "name": "-",
    "of": "zarp:the_camp"
  },
  "stages": [
    {
      "text": "Go below. Build the frame, light it, step through.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "place",
          "label": "the Nether",
          "dimension": "minecraft:the_nether"
        }
      ],
      "on_enter": [
        {
          "type": "flag",
          "name": "zarp_below_begun",
          "player": false,
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "type": "npc_say",
          "text": "&7Fortress. There's always a fortress. Bring me something from its heart.",
          "radius": 16.0,
          "quest": "zarp:the_camp"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Find a fortress. Something in there has been waiting for a visitor.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "place",
          "label": "a fortress",
          "structure": "minecraft:fortress",
          "dimension": "minecraft:the_nether"
        }
      ],
      "on_complete": [
        {
          "type": "spawn",
          "count": 1,
          "radius": 6,
          "genus": "zarp:fortress_warden",
          "entity": "minecraft:wither_skeleton",
          "name": "&4Fortress Warden",
          "tag": "warden",
          "health": 120
        },
        {
          "type": "title",
          "title": "&4&lFortress Warden",
          "subtitle": "&7It has been waiting."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Warden's heart, and four rods of the things that burn here.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "kill",
          "target": [
            "zarp:fortress_warden",
            "minecraft:wither_skeleton"
          ],
          "count": 1,
          "tag": "warden",
          "drop": {
            "quest_item": "zarp:ember_heart",
            "chance": 1.0
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "collect",
          "item": "minecraft:blaze_rod",
          "count": 4,
          "consume": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Kindle it. Okafor drew the shape: a blast furnace ringed in soul sand, the heart in your hand. Right-click the furnace.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "ritual",
          "block": "minecraft:blast_furnace",
          "label": "Kindle the Crucible",
          "pattern": [
            {
              "offset": [
                1,
                0,
                0
              ],
              "block": "minecraft:soul_sand"
            },
            {
              "offset": [
                -1,
                0,
                0
              ],
              "block": "minecraft:soul_sand"
            },
            {
              "offset": [
                0,
                0,
                1
              ],
              "block": "minecraft:soul_sand"
            },
            {
              "offset": [
                0,
                0,
                -1
              ],
              "block": "minecraft:soul_sand"
            }
          ],
          "item": "zarp:ember_heart",
          "consume": true
        }
      ],
      "on_enter": [
        {
          "type": "message",
          "text": "&7Soul sand on all four sides of a blast furnace. The heart in your hand. Then use the furnace.",
          "action_bar": false
        }
      ],
      "on_complete": [
        {
          "type": "spawn",
          "count": 1,
          "radius": 4,
          "genus": "zarp:cinder",
          "entity": "minecraft:blaze",
          "name": "&6The Cinder",
          "tag": "cinder",
          "health": 150
        },
        {
          "type": "title",
          "title": "&6&lThe Cinder",
          "subtitle": "&7It burnt, and it kept walking."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cinder. Put it out. Keep what is left.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "kill",
          "target": [
            "zarp:cinder",
            "minecraft:blaze"
          ],
          "count": 1,
          "tag": "cinder",
          "drop": {
            "quest_item": "zarp:living_flame",
            "chance": 1.0
          }
        }
      ],
      "on_complete": [
        {
          "type": "npc_say",
          "text": "&7Living fire. Don't put it near the tents.",
          "radius": 16.0,
          "quest": "zarp:the_camp"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rewards": [
    {
      "type": "xp",
      "amount": 200
    },
    {
      "type": "money",
      "amount": 60
    },
    {
      "type": "reputation",
      "standing": "camp",
      "delta": 15
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "title": "&6&lBelow",
      "subtitle": "&7You brought fire back."
    }
  ]
}
